# PyInstaller ONEDIR build output for speechmatics_engine. It's a FOLDER (executable +
# hundreds of dependency files under _internal/), never committed: Xcode's file-system-
# synchronized Resources group copies nested folders file-by-file and collides on
# duplicate basenames across _internal/*.dist-info dirs (entry_points.txt, top_level.txt,
# etc). CI builds this fresh each release and copies it directly into the EXPORTED,
# already-archived .app bundle — bypassing Xcode's Copy Bundle Resources phase for this
# path entirely. Local devs who need to test the Python engine build it themselves via
# `pyinstaller speechmatics_engine.spec` and copy the output into the BUILT app's
# Contents/Resources/speechmatics_engine (not this source folder).
InterviewCopilot/InterviewCopilot/Resources/speechmatics_engine/
